                    <span id="lblMinimumReqsInClassSpec">You will find the Minimum Requirements in the Class Specification.</span><ul><li><a href='https://hrnet.calhr.ca.gov/CalHRNet/SpecCrossReference.aspx?ClassID=7784' target='_blank'>MEDICAL CONSULTANT I, DEPARTMENT OF SOCIAL SERVICES</a></li></ul>
                </div>
            

