            <div id="pnlDepartmentInfo" class="col col-half">
	

                <h3 class="postingHeader">Department Information</h3>

                <div class="postingContent">
		
                    <p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">Are you interested in making a difference in the lives of fellow Californians while achieving your career goals?&nbsp; Do you set high standards for yourself and enjoy a collaborative and challenging work environment?&nbsp; The California Department of Social Services (CDSS) serves, aids, and protects needy and vulnerable children and adults in ways that strengthen and preserve families, encourage personal responsibility, and foster independence.&nbsp; CDSS employees are our most important resource in serving California’s needy and vulnerable children and families.<br /><br /> </span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 8pt; line-height: 1.07917;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">The mission of Disability Determination Service is to serve, aid, and protect needy vulnerable children and adults in ways that strengthen and preserve families, encourage personal responsibility, and foster independence.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">CDSS’ goal is to foster a culture that values diversity, equity, and inclusion within our department, that actively invites the contribution and participation of all people and is representative of the varied identities and different perspectives in California. In our role as public administrators, our charge is to ensure that our programs and our workplaces provide all Californians the opportunity to thrive.</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"> <br /> </span></p>
                
	</div>

                

                <div style="text-align: left;">
                    <img id="imgDeptLogo" src="data:image/jpg;base64," alt="Department Logo" style="max-height: 200px; padding-top: 25px;" />
                </div>

            
</div>

        </div>

        <div class="jcBand">

